Six-subagent Rust promotion dossier and inventory validation

Summary:
- Added machine-readable Rust core promotion dossier example under docs/source/_static.
- Extended migration inventory with native and Python-only model keys.
- Generalized CI JSON validation for Rust core inventory/dossier artifacts.
- Documented promotion dossier capture commands for Rust CPU flamegraph metadata, DHAT memory profiles, and XLA CPU/GPU benchmark JSON.
- Added tests for inventory schema, mixed ownership, promotion evidence categories, dossier evidence sections, crate docs-only decisions, and CI validation.

Validation:
- uv run ruff check .
- uv run ruff format --check .
- pytest tests/unit/test_benchmark_docs.py tests/unit/test_rust_binding_docs.py tests/unit/test_rust_core_roadmap_docs.py tests/unit/test_rust_core_migration_inventory.py tests/unit/test_prose_lint_docs.py tests/unit/test_conductor_workflow_docs.py
- find ../../docs/source/_static -type f \( -name 'rust_core_*inventory*.json' -o -name 'rust_core_*dossier*.json' \) ... python3 -m json.tool
- python3 -m json.tool docs/source/_static/rust_core_migration_inventory.json
- python3 -m json.tool docs/source/_static/rust_core_promotion_dossier_example.json
- uv run python -m sphinx -b html docs/source /tmp/innovate-docs-build
- cargo package --list --allow-dirty profiling file check
